#pragma once
// FMOD Studio bank (.bank, HSL homes' audio) -> the home's ambience bed as a standalone Ogg Vorbis stream, the same
// sound a Clay home ships as _BACKGROUND_LOOP.ogg (Space Station: the bank's 4-layer bed matches it at r=0.997).
// FSB5 Vorbis packets carry no Vorbis headers: each is [u16 size][packet], and the setup packet is named by a CRC32
// in the sample's extra chunk 0x0B. The id header is rebuilt (blocksizes 256/2048, FMOD's), the setup comes from the
// table below, and the packets are paged with exact granules so the loop ends on its last sample.
// Format notes and the setup packets: vgmstream (src/meta/fsb5.c, src/coding/libs/vorbis_codebooks_fsb.h, ISC-style
// license, Copyright (c) 2008-2025 Adam Gashlin, Fastelbja, Ronny Elfert, bnnm, et al), extracted by python-fsb5.
